    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Garuda Indonesia\nTimetable\nU.S.A Edition\nApril 1st, 1991 to\nOctober 27st, 1991\nVISIT\nINDAR ISTA",
      "We're a lot bigger\nthan most travelers think.\n• MEDAN\nLAKE TOBA\nSUMATRA\nJAKARTA\nJAVA\nSURABAYA\nYOGYAKARTA\nKALIMANTAN\nBALIKPAPAN\nUJUNG PANDANG •\nBALI\nLOMBOK\nSUL\n• TORAJ.\nIRIAN JAYA\nGaruda Indonesia, serving 4\ncontinents and 23 countries\nfor more than forty years, is\nthe largest airline in the\nSouthern Hemisphere.\n- ABU DHABI\n- ADELAIDE\n- AMSTERDAM\n-- AUCKLAND\n- BANGKOK\n- BRISBANE\n-- BRUSSELS\n- - BALI\n•- BIAK\n- DARWIN\n- FUKUOKA\n- FRANKFURT\n- HO CHI MINH\n- HONG KONG\n- HONOLULU\n- JAKARTA\n- JEDDAH\n- KUALA LUMPUR\n- LONDON\n- LOS ANGELES\n--- MANILA\n- MELBOURNE\n- MENADO\nNAGOYA\n-- PARIS\n-- PERTH\n- PORT HEDLAND\n-- RIYADH\n- ROME\n- SEOUL\n- SINGAPORE\n- SYDNEY\n- VIENNA\n- ZURICH\nGaruda Indonesia"
    ],
